  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project with the Direction Gnrale des Impts is focused on improving the arrears process; improving audit skills and management; assisting in change management and other support for the implementation of the SISIC information technology upgrade; developing standardized procedures and training anti-corruption investigators; creating a strategic plan and pilot management training.</narrative>
